  <name>Pattern Test</name>
  <summary>Pattern matching test tool for command-line utilities</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Pattern Test is a comprehensive testing tool that helps verify how different
      command-line utilities (tar, rsync, find, glob) handle various pattern matching
      syntaxes including wildcards, regular expressions, extended globs, character sets,
      and path patterns.
    </p>
    <p>
      Features:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Test pattern matching for multiple tools (tar, rsync, find, glob)</li>
      <li>Support for various pattern types (wildcards, regex, extended globs, character sets, path patterns)</li>
      <li>Multiple output formats (text, HTML, LaTeX, PDF, CSV, Markdown)</li>
      <li>Detailed test reports with expected vs actual matches</li>
      <li>Flexible logging with multiple verbosity levels</li>
      <li>Color-coded output for better readability</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      This tool is particularly useful for developers and system administrators who need
      to understand and verify pattern matching behavior across different command-line tools.
    </p>
  </description>
